# The innkeeper offers a room for the night. Exercises a rest at an inn,
# the save prompt, ambient sound and the actor commands (place, a route,
# a direction, standard animations, remove) in a skippable scene.

event inn_counter skippable
	lock player
	ambient play hearth_crackle
	place innkeeper stall_counter facing south
	anim innkeeper fade_in
	face innkeeper traveler
	say innkeeper @inn.greeting as warm
	ask @inn.stay_question into inn.stayed
	yes
		fade out 1.0
		rest harbor_inn
		fade in 1.0
		say innkeeper @inn.morning as warm
		save prompt
	no
		say innkeeper @inn.another_time
		face innkeeper west
		move innkeeper via stall_counter to door_inside speed 1.5 pathfind
		anim innkeeper fade_out
		remove innkeeper until reload
	end
	ambient stop
	unlock player
end
